OL,3,GNEWSADeal between BBC and council to go
OL,4,Aahead despite opposition
OL,5,
OL,6,FA proposed deal between the BBC and
OL,7,FBelfast City Council over a new studio
OL,8,Fin the city centre is going ahead in
OL,9,Fspite of opposition from Sinn Fein.
OL,11,FThe party tried to overturn an
OL,12,Fagreement which involves the new #100m
OL,13,FBelfast Stories visitor attraction due
OL,14,Fto be built in the city by 2030.
OL,16,FSinn Fein challenged a decision taken
OL,17,Fin July by the 60-member council to go
OL,18,Fahead with the proposed deal.
OL,20,FLegal advice was then taken by the
OL,21,Fcouncil but no fault was found in the
OL,22,Fdecision.
